        "text": "Retaliation Concern"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "text": {
        "type": "plain_text",
        "text": "1. Document the business rationale for the adverse action independently of any prior protected activity.\n2. Brief HR on the full timeline — when the protected activity occurred and when the performance issue arose.\n3. Confirm the employee has received written notice of their anti-retaliation rights."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "text": {
        "type": "plain_text",
        "text": "Do not take any adverse action — including a conversation, a schedule change, or a performance warning — without HR and legal review first. The risk here is significant."
      }
